      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANABALLISTIC (4) returned from a spell last start with a strong win by a head over 1000m at this track, when defeating a key rival here in BOSISTO. Has placed in two of three second-up runs as well, so no reason she won't hold the good form here. BOSISTO (3) wasn't far behind ANABALLISTIC last start, though, so doesn't need much to go his way to turn the tables. LUCKY I AM (2) held on well to finish third last time out over 1000m at this track after leading for much of the way. Solid run last start and is among the chances again. EYE OF THE SUN (5) was put away after the plain debut but has been good at two runs this time in and should be up to this company.",
